    "body": "## Motivation\n\nLLAMA2-style templates derive message tags and separators from index parity. Two consecutive user messages therefore label the second one as an assistant and end the generation prompt with `[INST]` instead of `[/INST]`.\n\nFixes #43155.\n\n## Modifications\n\nUse each message's stored role for its tag and turn separator. Preserve the existing first-user prefix handling, and render a leading assistant message with its assistant tag. Add regressions for consecutive users across the `llama-2`, `mistral`, and `devstral` templates, consecutive assistants, and an assistant-first history. Pin the complete alternating-history prompt to preserve its existing output.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nRebased onto `9fa9308e95`, which contains the required base `ff8d964cf5`. On this source, 79 conversation tests and 3 subtests pass on CPU; the non-alternating-role regressions fail with the unmodified main production code.\n\n`pre-commit run --all-files` passes, including the Rust formatting and Clippy checks.\n\nThese are feature-specific CPU serialization tests; model-forward and kernel code are unchanged.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nOnly prompt serialization changed; no speed benchmark was run.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format code with pre-commit (all applicable hooks passed for the changed files).\n- [x] Add unit tests in the existing registered CPU test file.\n- [x] Documentation checked; no API or configuration change requires documentation.\n- [x] Provide feature-specific correctness results; no model-forward or kernel change.\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style guidance.\n\n## Review and Merge Process\n\nThe standard Merge Oncall, CODEOWNERS, and CI review process applies.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38669858216](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38669858216)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38669858023](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38669858023)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38669858105](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38669858105)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
